WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.830
Open a Qur'an today.

2
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.650
It has 114 surahs, or chapters.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.290
Muslims believe every word in it
is the speech of God, in Arabic.

4
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.640
And it did not arrive all at once.

5
00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.320
Muslims believe it came
over about 23 years.

6
00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:20.280
So how did words revealed
in pieces become one book?

7
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.130
In this mission, you'll see how
Muslims believe revelation came,

8
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.910
through the angel Jibril.

9
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.570
Then you'll see why Muslims
believe it came down by stages,

10
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.140
not all at once.

11
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:36.280
Your mission: find out how 23 years
of revelation became one book.
